#NEXUS

[ csiki2010b_fig3: Dromaeosaurid time tree. Multi-way nodes: Sinornithosaurus, the Graciliraptor-Microraptor node and the unenlagiine node; Graciliraptor with the two Microraptor species (stem entering at M. zhaoianus' height); Shanag, Neuquenraptor, Buitreraptor and Rahonavis; Achillobator, Adasaurus, Utahraptor and Dromaeosaurus. No clade names are printed. 18 tips, 4 polytomies (3, 3, 4, 4 children). Sample 4 case (census 2, seed 20261201). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=18;
    TAXLABELS
        Mahakala
        Sinornithosaurus
        Graciliraptor
        Microraptor_zhaoianus
        Microraptor_gui
        Shanag
        Neuquenraptor
        Buitreraptor
        Rahonavis
        Achillobator
        Adasaurus
        Utahraptor
        Dromaeosaurus
        Tsaagan
        Saurornitholestes
        Deinonychus
        Velociraptor
        Balaur
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE csiki2010b_fig3 = [&R] (Mahakala,((Sinornithosaurus,(Graciliraptor,Microraptor_zhaoianus,Microraptor_gui),(Shanag,Neuquenraptor,Buitreraptor,Rahonavis)),((Achillobator,Adasaurus,Utahraptor,Dromaeosaurus),(Tsaagan,(Saurornitholestes,(Deinonychus,(Velociraptor,Balaur)))))));
END;
